<p>Hi there,</p>
<p>according to my internet history I was aware of the SCP-Foundation since the summer of 2019. It came to my attention due to me looking for material to use in a Pen and Paper, afterwards I went deeper while watching videos about the Containment Breach videos and since that time I read some entries here. Also I recently started with reading tales from the Canon Hub.</p>
<p>I caught myself having thoughts about writing SCPs of my own and have some ideas there, which is why I decided to finally join. With that I could maybe start voting and share my opinion</p>
<p>One of the earliest SCPs I have read and think about now and then would be the soup bowl <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-348">SCP-348</a>. Another I like to think about would be red ice <a href="/scp-009">SCP-009</a>.</p>
<p>The best kind of food to eat with friends would be the one you make together. You can then see preferences of your friends in there and try something out for yourself as well. Also cooking together is more fun.</p>
<p>I hope I can make some of your time more entertaining.</p>

